@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+---
+category: Enhancements
+authors: [actual-agent]
+---
+
+Schedules with a ranged or approximate amount now plan for the lowest amount they allow. For money coming in, that is the end closest to zero, so a salary "between 1,010.00 and 2,000.00" is planned at 1,010.00.
